### Criar autor
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Machado de Assis", "nationality": "Brasileira", "birthDate": "1839-06-21" }

### Listar autores
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/authors

### Editar autor
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/authors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nationality": "Brasileiro" }

### Criar leitor
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/readers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Silva", "cpf": "12345678900", "email": "maria@email.com", "phone": "44999990000" }

### Criar leitor com CPF repetido
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/readers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Outra Pessoa", "cpf": "12345678900" }

### Histórico do leitor
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/readers/1/loans

### Leitor que não existe
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/readers/999